{"schemaVersion":1,"patchVersion":"26.6","previousPatchVersion":"26.5","sources":{"ddragon":"16.6.1","cdragon":"16.6"},"previousSources":{"ddragon":"16.5.1","cdragon":"16.5"},"comparedChampions":172,"comparedItems":312,"entries":[{"id":"Shyvana","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나","en_US":"Shyvana","zh_CN":"龙血武姬"},"changes":[{"id":"official/0/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/0/0","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"P","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"미늘갑옷","en_US":"Scalemail","zh_CN":"龙鳞铁衣"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"챔피언, 대형 미니언 및 몬스터 처치 관여 시 쉬바나가 미늘갑옷 중첩을 얻으며, 중첩 하나당 영구히 방어력이 0.4, 마법 저항력이 0.4 증가합니다.","en_US":"Takedowns on champions, large minions, and monsters earn Shyvana stacks of Scalemail; each stack grants Shyvana permanent 0.4 Armor and 0.4 Magic Resist.","zh_CN":"參與擊殺英雄、大型士兵和野怪會讓希瓦娜獲得「真龍鱗甲」堆層，每層永久提升0.4物防和0.4魔防。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/0/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/0/1","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"P","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"미늘갑옷","en_US":"Scalemail","zh_CN":"龙鳞铁衣"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"대형 몬스터 및 공성 미니언은 1중첩을 부여합니다.","en_US":"Large monsters and siege minions grant 1 stack.","zh_CN":"大型野怪和攻城士兵會提供1層效果。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/0/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/0/2","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"P","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"미늘갑옷","en_US":"Scalemail","zh_CN":"龙鳞铁衣"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"챔피언 및 에픽 몬스터는 3중첩을 부여합니다.","en_US":"Champions and Epic monsters grant 3 stacks.","zh_CN":"擊殺英雄和史詩級野怪則會提供3層效果。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/1/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/1/0","gameDataKey":"Shyvana/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간","en_US":"Cooldown","zh_CN":"冷卻時間"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"잉걸불 일격","en_US":"Emberstrike","zh_CN":"焚焰打击"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"6초","en_US":"6 seconds","zh_CN":"6秒"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/1/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/1/1","gameDataKey":"Shyvana/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"기본 지속 효과","en_US":"Passive","zh_CN":"被動"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"잉걸불 일격","en_US":"Emberstrike","zh_CN":"焚焰打击"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"기본 공격 적중 시 최대 체력의 1%(+공격력 100당 1.7%+주문력 100당 1.3%)만큼 마법 피해를 입히고, 이 스킬의 재사용 대기시간이 1.25초 감소합니다.","en_US":"Shyvana's Attacks deal 1% (+1.7% per 100 AD + 1.3% per 100 AP) max Health magic damage On-Hit and reduce this Ability's cooldown by 1.25 seconds.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜的普攻會附加1%（每100物攻+1.7%，每100魔攻+1.3%）最大生命魔法傷害命中效果，並使此技能的冷卻時間縮短1.25秒。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/1/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/1/2","gameDataKey":"Shyvana/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"사용 시","en_US":"Active","zh_CN":"主動"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"잉걸불 일격","en_US":"Emberstrike","zh_CN":"焚焰打击"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나의 다음 기본 공격이 대상 및 주변 지역을 타격해 10~30(+공격력의 110%)(+주문력의 25%)의 물리 피해를 입힙니다. 이 스킬은 공격 후 또는 잠시 후 4초 안에 재사용할 수 있습니다.","en_US":"Shyvana's next Attack strikes the target and the surrounding area, dealing 10-30 (+ 110% AD) (+ 25% AP) physical damage. This Ability may be Recast after an Attack or short delay within the next 4 seconds.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜下一次普攻會打擊目標及其周圍區域，造成10-30（+110%物攻）（+25%魔攻）物理傷害。此技能在普攻後或短暫延遲後的4秒內可重新施放。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/1/3","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/1/3","gameDataKey":"Shyvana/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"용 형상","en_US":"Dragon Form","zh_CN":"聖龍型態"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"잉걸불 일격","en_US":"Emberstrike","zh_CN":"焚焰打击"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나가 추가로 1회 더 재사용할 수 있으며 다음 기본 공격 시 대상을 물어뜯어 15~45(+공격력의 165%)(+주문력의 37.5%)의 고정 피해를 입힙니다.","en_US":"Shyvana gains an additional Recast, causing her to bite the target of her next Attack, dealing 15-45 (+ 165% AD) (+ 37.5% AP) true damage.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜獲得額外重施技能次數，使其撕咬下一次普攻的目標，造成15-45（+165%物攻）（+37.5%魔攻）真實傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/2/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/2/0","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaWAbility/ShyvanaW/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간","en_US":"Cooldown","zh_CN":"冷卻時間"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"지옥불 방패","en_US":"Inferno Aegis","zh_CN":"烈火圣盾"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"12초","en_US":"12 seconds","zh_CN":"12秒"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/2/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/2/1","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaWAbility/ShyvanaW/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"지옥불 방패","en_US":"Inferno Aegis","zh_CN":"烈火圣盾"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나가 2.5초 동안 화염으로 몸을 감싸 60~140(+체력의 5%)의 보호막을 얻습니다. 보호막 흡수량은 주변 적 챔피언 한 명당 24~42(+체력의 1.5%)만큼 증가합니다. 또한 이동 속도가 25% 증가하며, 적 챔피언에게 접근 시 44%까지 증가합니다. 효과가 종료되거나 보호막이 파괴되거나 스킬을 재사용할 경우 폭발하여 주변에 80~160(+추가 공격력의 40%)(+주문력의 20%)의 마법 피해를 입힙니다.","en_US":"Shyvana wraps herself in flames for 2.5 seconds, gaining 60-140 (+ 5% HP) Shield, increased by 24-42 (+ 1.5%) HP per nearby enemy champion, and 25% Move Speed, increased to 44% when moving towards enemy champions. When the effect ends, the shield is broken, or upon Recast, the area around her detonates, dealing 80-160 (+ 40% bonus AD) (+ 20% AP) magic damage.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜將自己包覆在烈焰中，持續2.5秒，獲得60-140（+5%生命）護盾，附近每有一名敵方英雄則額外增加24-42（+1.5%生命）護盾，並獲得25%跑速，朝敵方英雄移動時提升至44%。效果結束、護盾被打破，或重施技能時，她周圍的區域會爆炸，造成80-160（+40%額外物攻）（+20%魔攻）魔法傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/2/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/2/2","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaWAbility/ShyvanaW/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"용 형상","en_US":"Dragon Form","zh_CN":"聖龍型態"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"지옥불 방패","en_US":"Inferno Aegis","zh_CN":"烈火圣盾"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"폭발이 적 챔피언에게 적중하면 쉬바나가 잃은 체력에 비례해 최소 100~250(+추가 공격력의 10%)(+주문력의 5%), 최대 200~500(+추가 공격력의 20%)(+주문력의 10%)의 체력을 회복합니다.","en_US":"If the detonation hits an enemy champion, Shyvana restores from 100-250 (+ 10% bonus AD) (+ 5% AP) to 200-500 (+ 20% bonus AD) (+ 10% AP) Health based on her missing Health.","zh_CN":"若爆炸命中敵方英雄，則希瓦娜根據自身已損失生命，回復100-250（+10%額外物攻）（+5%魔攻）至200-500（+20%額外物攻）（+10%魔攻）生命。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/3/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/3/0","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaEAbility/ShyvanaE/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"재사용 대기시간","en_US":"Cooldown","zh_CN":"冷卻時間"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용암 분출","en_US":"Molten Burst","zh_CN":"爆炎吐息"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"10초","en_US":"10 seconds","zh_CN":"10秒"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/3/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/3/1","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaEAbility/ShyvanaE/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용암 분출","en_US":"Molten Burst","zh_CN":"爆炎吐息"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나가 대상 지역에 화염구를 날려 80~240(+추가 공격력의 50%)(+주문력의 70%)의 마법 피해를 입히고 2초 동안 50%만큼 둔화시킵니다. 화염구가 적에게 적중하거나 한계에 도달하면 폭발합니다.","en_US":"Shyvana launches a fireball at the target location dealing 80-240 (+ 50% bonus AD) (+ 70% AP) magic damage and Slowing by 50% for 2 seconds. It explodes upon striking an enemy or reaching its terminus.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜朝目標發射火球，造成80-240（+50%額外物攻）（+70%魔攻）魔法傷害與50%緩速，持續2秒。火球在命中敵軍或抵達終點時會爆炸。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/3/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/3/2","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaEAbility/ShyvanaE/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"용 형상","en_US":"Dragon Form","zh_CN":"聖龍型態"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용암 분출","en_US":"Molten Burst","zh_CN":"爆炎吐息"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나의 화염구가 더 커지고 적을 관통합니다. 챔피언 또는 대형 몬스터에게 적중하거나 한계에 도달하면 불의 파동을 일으켜 100~300(+추가 공격력의 62.5%)(+주문력의 87.5%)의 마법 피해를 입히고 2초 동안 50%만큼 둔화시킵니다. 화염구가 지나간 자리에 2초 동안 흔적이 남아 매초 5~25(+주문력의 5%)의 마법 피해를 입힙니다.","en_US":"Shyvana's fireball is larger and pierces through enemies. Upon striking a champion, large monster, or reaching its terminus it triggers a pulse of fire that deals 100-300 (+ 62.5% bonus AD) (+ 87.5% AP) magic damage and Slows by 50% for 2 seconds. The fireball leaves behind a trail for 2 seconds that deals 5-25 (+ 5% AP) magic damage per second.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜的火球變大，且能貫穿敵軍。命中英雄、大型野怪或抵達終點時，會觸發一道火焰脈衝，造成100-300（+62.5%額外物攻）（+87.5%魔攻）魔法傷害並緩速50%，持續2秒。火球會留下一條火痕，持續2秒，每秒造成5-25（+5%魔攻）魔法傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/0","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaRAbility/ShyvanaR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용의 강림","en_US":"Dragon's Descent","zh_CN":"魔龙降世"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"사용하려면 분노가 100 필요합니다.","en_US":"Requires 100 Fury to activate.","zh_CN":"需要100點怒氣才能啟動。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/1","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaRAbility/ShyvanaR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"기본 지속 효과","en_US":"Passive","zh_CN":"被動"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용의 강림","en_US":"Dragon's Descent","zh_CN":"魔龙降世"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나가 기본 공격 또는 스킬로 적을 타격하면 용의 분노가 1.25 생성됩니다. 용의 분노 생성량은 용 형상일 때 200% 증가하며, 챔피언이 아닌 대상에게 광역 피해를 입힐 때 75% 감소합니다.","en_US":"Shyvana generates 1.25 Dragon Fury by striking enemies with Attacks and Abilities, increased by 200% while in Dragon Form, and reduced 75% when striking in an area against non-champions.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜用普攻和技能攻擊敵軍會生成1.25點龍族怒氣，在聖龍型態下生成量增加200%，對非英雄目標進行範圍攻擊時生成量降低75%。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/2","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/2","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaRAbility/ShyvanaR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"사용 시","en_US":"Active","zh_CN":"主動"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용의 강림","en_US":"Dragon's Descent","zh_CN":"魔龙降世"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"쉬바나가 용 형상으로 변신해 저지 불가 상태가 되고, 대상 위치로 날아가며 경로에 불을 내뿜습니다. 범위 내 적은 150~350(+주문력의 100%)의 마법 피해를 입고 1초 동안 달아납니다.","en_US":"Shyvana transforms into her Dragon Form, becoming Unstoppable, and flying to the target location breathing fire on enemies below dealing 150-350 (+ 100% AP) magic damage and causing them to Flee for 1 second.","zh_CN":"希瓦娜變身為聖龍型態，進入無人能擋狀態，飛向指定位置，朝下方敵軍噴吐火焰，造成150-350（+100%魔攻）魔法傷害並使其逃跑1秒。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/3","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/3","gameDataKey":"Characters/Shyvana/Spells/ShyvanaRAbility/ShyvanaR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"용의 강림","en_US":"Dragon's Descent","zh_CN":"魔龙降世"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"용 형상일 때 쉬바나의 기본 스킬이 강화됩니다. 또한 150~350의 추가 체력을 얻고, 크기가 커지며, 공격 사거리가 증가합니다. 쉬바나는 지속적으로 용의 분노를 잃으며, 남은 용의 분노가 없을 경우 변신이 종료됩니다.","en_US":"While transformed, Shyvana's basic Abilities are upgraded, she gains 150-350 bonus Health, size, and Attack Range. Shyvana loses Dragon Fury over time and her transformation ends when she has no Dragon Fury remaining.","zh_CN":"變身時，希瓦娜的基礎技能會升級，並獲得150-350額外生命、體型和攻擊距離。希瓦娜會逐漸失去龍族怒氣，耗盡龍族怒氣時，變身就會結束。"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Ahri","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"아리","en_US":"Ahri","zh_CN":"九尾妖狐"},"changes":[{"id":"official/1/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/1/0/0","gameDataKey":"Characters/Ahri/Spells/AhriQAbility/AhriQ/values/BaseDamag